  <h1>Technical &amp; Regulatory Team</h1>
  <p class="lede">The expertise behind this site's technical content. Named teams, each with a defined scope, so readers can judge the authority behind a page.</p>

  <p>All technical content on this site is authored and reviewed by <strong>Progene Tech Team</strong> — Nanjing Progene Biotechnology's collective byline for the three teams below.</p>

  <h2>Regulatory Affairs Team</h2>
  <p><strong>Expertise:</strong> IVD regulation, ISO 13485 quality management, CE conformity (IVDD/IVDR), and medical-device registration in China and international markets.</p>
  <p>Owns the accuracy of regulatory claims, certification wording, and the <a href="/evidence/certifications/">certifications &amp; regulatory</a> and <a href="/evidence/company-registration/">company registration</a> evidence.</p>

  <h2>Technical Team</h2>
  <p><strong>Expertise:</strong> Lateral-flow immunoassay (LFIA), immunochromatography, colloidal-gold conjugation, and assay development.</p>
  <p>Owns the mechanism-level technical content — the <a href="/knowledge/immunochromatography/">immunochromatography</a>, <a href="/knowledge/technology/lateral-flow/">lateral-flow</a> and <a href="/knowledge/technology/conjugation/">conjugation</a> pages.</p>

  <h2>Product &amp; Application Team</h2>
  <p><strong>Expertise:</strong> Infectious-disease diagnostics, drug-of-abuse (DOA) testing, POCT, and veterinary diagnostics.</p>
  <p>Owns the analyte, disease-hub and application content, and the buyer-facing guidance in the <a href="/knowledge/buyer-evaluate-manufacturer/">Buyer Knowledge Hub</a>.</p>

  <h2>How this affects the content</h2>
  <p>Every technical page is attributed to one of these teams, with a last-reviewed date. We separate <strong>verified facts</strong> (with sources) from <strong>editorial judgement</strong> (labelled as "The Author's Take"), so a reader can tell which is which.</p>

